:name: STM32F4 firmware - serial fuzz target
:description: Loads the parser firmware on an emulated STM32F4 Discovery.
#
# Interactive use:
#   renode renode/firmware.resc
# then type packets into the USART2 analyzer window, e.g. a benign frame.
#
# CI uses renode/fuzz_target.robot instead (headless, asserts on output).

using sysbus

$elf ?= @firmware/build/firmware.elf

mach create "stm32f4"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/boards/stm32f4_discovery.repl

sysbus LoadELF $elf

showAnalyzer sysbus.usart2

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $elf
"""

echo "Loaded firmware. 'start' to run; interact on USART2."
